ge Obstacles:</strong> Unlock new rules as you climb and overcome fresh challenges with your crew.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned Updates</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More levels, more animals (of course!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score ranking (challenge your limits!!!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Used Animal Encyclopedia (learn more about your partners)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty options (think the original isn\u2019t hard enough?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret shop (buy some weird stuff\u2026 really weird)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Lao"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963980/4b3a6360cac5e1c6570b2c69dfaffa8050b3225b/header.jpg?t=1762497249","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3963980/330960330/e2dc5d018f649c2c83c8821aa90b7be1bed95829/1761895597/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761972969","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3963980/330960330/e2dc5d018f649c2c83c8821aa90b7be1bed95829/1761895597/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761972969","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3963980/330960330/e2dc5d018f649c2c83c8821aa90b7be1bed95829/1761895597/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761972969","id":257224991,"name":"NewVideo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257224991/64d497439e3216d5b59a9f69ec11256c341a1852/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761972969"}],"name":"Why Elephant Sit On Chair?","package_groups"